1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,699
OptimumBank's third quarter: a
record profit that beat the Street.

2
00:00:05,249 --> 00:00:09,398
Earnings of thirty cents a share
topped the twenty-seven cent
consensus.

3
00:00:09,948 --> 00:00:16,517
Revenue rose fifty-one percent to
nineteen point six million dollars, the
fastest of four Florida peers.

4
00:00:17,067 --> 00:00:21,295
Its four point six three percent margin
and forty-five point nine percent

5
00:00:21,295 --> 00:00:24,128
efficiency ratio were both best in the
group.

6
00:00:24,678 --> 00:00:30,423
But loans grew sixty-eight percent
while the reserve thinned to zero
point eight nine percent of loans.

7
00:00:30,973 --> 00:00:37,091
Net interest income drove the gain,
and a one-time late fee added about
nine hundred thousand dollars.

8
00:00:37,641 --> 00:00:41,831
The question now is whether that
growth can last without thinner
reserves.

